// Structs work basically like in zig
// Enums work basically like in zig
// Unions work basically like in zig
// Tagged unions work basically like in zig
// Errors work basically like in zig

// Builtin types:
//    i8, i16, i32, i64, i128 - signed integer with 8, 16, 32, 64, 128 bits
//    u8, u16, u32, u64, u128 - unsigned integer with 8, 16, 32, 64, 128 bits
//    comptime_int - compiletime known signed integer
//    f16, f32, f64, f80, f128 - floating point number with 16, 32, 64, 80, 128 bits
//    comptime_float - compiletime known floating point number
//
//    bool - boolean
//    void - size 0 type
//    type - type

// optional type is represented as `?type_name`

